fullDescription:
Sometimes you know you want to say no, but finding the words is hard. Grens helps you respond calmly and clearly, without a long explanation.

Choose a situation and a tone. You receive three short phrases that you can copy, adapt or save. You can also add what the request is about.

With Grens you can also:
• write, organise and find your own phrases;
• plan recurring moments for your daily rhythm;
• check off moments for each day;
• manually export and import your own phrases and rhythm;
• switch between Dutch and English.

Everything happens on your device. Grens has no account, advertising, analytics or backend, and it does not transmit your phrases or daily rhythm. The app works without an internet connection. An export is created only when you explicitly choose to make one.

Grens is a tool for finding words and calm. It is not therapy or medical advice.
